 ical←{
 ⍝ Generates iCalendar (.ics) format from structured course data
 ⍝
 ⍝ This function takes parsed course data and custom templates to create
 ⍝ an iCalendar file for importing into calendar applications.
 ⍝
 ⍝ Left argument (⍺):
 ⍝   summary desc dateFormat
 ⍝     summary    - Template for event titles (supports variables)
 ⍝     desc       - Template for event descriptions (supports variables)
 ⍝     dateFormat - 1 if dates are DD/MM/YYYY, 0 if MM/DD/YYYY (from uwsch/detectDateFormat)
 ⍝
 ⍝ Right argument (⍵):
 ⍝   Vector of course namespaces from uwsch function (not modified)
 ⍝
 ⍝ Template variables (replaced in summary and description):
 ⍝   @code     - Course code (e.g., 'ECE 150')
 ⍝   @section  - Section identifier
 ⍝   @name     - Course name/title
 ⍝   @type     - Component type (LEC, LAB, TUT, etc.)
 ⍝   @location - Room location
 ⍝   @prof     - Instructor name
 ⍝
 ⍝ Returns:
 ⍝   Complete iCalendar file content as character vector (RFC 5545: CRLF line
 ⍝   endings, long lines folded, UID and DTSTAMP on every event, VTIMEZONE for
 ⍝   America/Toronto, UNTIL in UTC, text escaped). DTSTAMP is the time of the call.

     summaryFmt descFmt dateFormat←⍺
     CRLF←⎕UCS 13 10
     date←(1+dateFormat)⊃'M/D/YYYY' 'D/M/YYYY'
     Day←{(date 1)⎕DT⊂⍵}                               ⍝ '05/01/2026' → day number
     At←{
     ⍝ Date ⍺ at time ⍵ → day number, with the time of day as the fraction.
     ⍝ Quest gives 24h ('15:30') or 12h ('3:30PM') times; ⎕DT validate mode tells them apart.
         s←⍺,' ',⍵
         p←date,' ',(1+(date,' h:mm')0 ⎕DT⊂s)⊃'t:mmPP' 'h:mm'
         (p 1)⎕DT⊂s
     }
     Stamp←{⊃(1 'YYYYMMDD"T"hhmmss')⎕DT ⍵}
     UntilUTC←{
     ⍝ 23:59 Toronto time on date ⍵, in UTC. ⎕DT has no time zones, so: Toronto is
     ⍝ UTC-4 from the 2nd Sunday in March to the 1st Sunday in November, else UTC-5.
         d←Day ⍵
         y←⊃⊃(1 ¯1)⎕DT d
         Sun←{f←1 ⎕DT⊂y ⍺ 1 ⋄ f+(7|-f)+7×⍵-1}          ⍝ month ⍺, ⍵th Sunday
         dst←(d≥3 Sun 2)∧d<11 Sun 1
         m←(1440×d)+(23×60)+59+60×5-dst               ⍝ whole minutes: no rounding
         t←(3↑⊃(1 ¯1)⎕DT⌊m÷1440),(⌊60÷⍨1440|m),(60|m),0
         ⊃(¯1 'YYYYMMDD"T"hhmmss"Z"')⎕DT⊂t
     }
     Escape←{∊{⍵∊'\;,':'\',⍵ ⋄ ⍵}¨⍵}                ⍝ RFC 5545 3.3.11 TEXT: \ ; , → \\ \; \,
     Fold←{
     ⍝ RFC 5545 3.1: a line over 75 octets continues on the next, after a space
         ⍺←75
         n←{≢'UTF-8'⎕UCS,⍵}¨⍵
         ⍺≥+/n:⍵
         k←+/⍺≥+\n
         (k↑⍵),CRLF,' ',74∇k↓⍵
     }
     now←⊃(¯1 'YYYYMMDD"T"hhmmss"Z"')⎕DT⊂⊃¯1 ⎕DT'Z'
     events←⊃,/{
         ⊃,/⍵{
             ⍝ Skip classes without scheduled times
             ⍵.starttime≡'':⍬
             ⍝ Apply template variable substitution
             summary desc←(⍺.code ⍵.section ⍺.name ⍵.component ⍵.room ⍵.instructor)∘{
                 repls←⍺
                 ('@code' '@section' '@name' '@type' '@location' '@prof'⎕R{repls⊃⍨1+⍵.PatternNum})⍵
             }¨summaryFmt descFmt
             ⍝ Days of the week as 0 (Sunday) to 6 (Saturday), like 7|day number
             days←{⍵⊆⍨+\~(⎕C ⎕A)∊⍨⍵}⍵.days                 ⍝ 'TTh' → 'T' 'Th'
             wd←0 1 2 3 4 5 6 6[(,¨'Su' 'M' 'T' 'W' 'Th' 'F' 'S' 'Sa')⍳days]
             ⍝ First meeting: the first class day on or after the start date
             addDay←⌊/7|wd-7|⌊⍵.start At ⍵.starttime
             start←Stamp addDay+⍵.start At ⍵.starttime

             ⍝ Lines of the VEVENT for this class
             e←⊂'BEGIN:VEVENT'
             e,←⊂'UID:',(⍺.code~' '),'-',⍵.section,'-',⍵.component,'-',(⍕⍵.number),'-',start,'@uw.bkaw.ca'
             e,←⊂'DTSTAMP:',now
             e,←⊂'DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:',start
             e,←⊂'DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:',Stamp addDay+⍵.start At ⍵.endtime
             ⍝ Recurrence rule (only if start is not end date), until the end of the last day
             e,←(⍵.start≢⍵.end)/⊂'RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=',(UntilUTC ⍵.end),';WKST=SU;BYDAY=',¯1↓∊('SU' 'MO' 'TU' 'WE' 'TH' 'FR' 'SA')[1+wd],¨','
             e,←⊂'SUMMARY:',Escape summary
             e,←⊂'DESCRIPTION:',Escape desc
             e,⊂'END:VEVENT'
         }¨⍵.classes  ⍝ Process each class in the course
     }¨⍵  ⍝ Process each course

     ⍝ Toronto's time zone, which DTSTART and DTEND refer to
     tz←'BEGIN:VTIMEZONE' 'TZID:America/Toronto'
     tz,←'BEGIN:DAYLIGHT' 'TZOFFSETFROM:-0500' 'TZOFFSETTO:-0400' 'TZNAME:EDT'
     tz,←'DTSTART:19700308T020000' 'RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3;BYDAY=2SU' 'END:DAYLIGHT'
     tz,←'BEGIN:STANDARD' 'TZOFFSETFROM:-0400' 'TZOFFSETTO:-0500' 'TZNAME:EST'
     tz,←'DTSTART:19701101T020000' 'RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=1SU' 'END:STANDARD'
     tz,←⊂'END:VTIMEZONE'

     ⍝ Wrap events in complete iCalendar structure, one CRLF-terminated line each
     lines←'BEGIN:VCALENDAR' 'VERSION:2.0' 'PRODID:-//uw.bkaw.ca//EN',tz,events,⊂'END:VCALENDAR'
     ∊(Fold¨lines),¨⊂CRLF
 }
